flowchart TD
    A([Evaluate Employee])
    --> B[Find all matching User Groups]
    --> C[Collect Roles from Group A]
    --> D[Collect Roles from Group B and others]
    --> E[Combine all Roles]
    --> F[Combine Permissions]
    --> G[Preserve each User Group Scope]
    --> H[Effective access is union]
    --> I([Completed])
